    "### Self-Attention in BERT\n",
    "\n",
    "BERT uses the Transformer attention mechanism.\n",
    "\n",
    "Core formula:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathrm{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right)V\n",
    "$$\n",
    "This allows every word to interact with every other word.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Bidirectional Understanding\n",
    "\n",
    "This is BERT’s biggest innovation.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Traditional Left-to-Right\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"The animal didn't cross the street because it was tired.\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "To understand “it”:\n",
    "\n",
    "A left-to-right model sees only earlier words.\n",
    "\n",
    "### BERT\n",
    "\n",
    "BERT sees:\n",
    "\n",
