    "## GPT Training Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT learns using:\n",
    "\n",
    "### Next Token Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "Input:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"The sun rises in the\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Target:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"east\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "The model repeatedly predicts the next token over massive text datasets.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Mathematical Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT minimizes prediction loss using cross-entropy.\n",
    "\n",
    "Goal:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "P(w_t\\mid w_1,w_2,...,w_{t-1})\n",
    "$$\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "\n",
    "Probability of current word given previous words."
   ]
